--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b59e5109641be024fb790db23ec12cf0, type: 3}
  m_Name: A_Warner
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: "Monsieur Warner, il aurait discut\xE9 avec elle avant le meurtre dans
      ses appartements. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Je croyais que leur relation appartenait au pass\xE9 ? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: dc808623fe61c0e4fa9d5c8b0b4bdfa1, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Apparemment elle souhaitait quand m\xEAme s\u2019entretenir avec lui.
      Ils m\u2019ont tous deux confirm\xE9 \xEAtre dans les appartements de Monsieur
      vers 19h20. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Je me demande bien de quoi ils ont discut\xE9, m\xEAme si \xE7a n\u2019a
      sans doute pas de rapport avec l\u2019enqu\xEAte ... "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94f552401d853464eba92c33f32b25fd, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "En tout cas nous avons d\xE9j\xE0 obtenu un bon nombre de t\xE9moignages
      et de preuves. Il est peut-\xEAtre tent\xE9 de faire le tri. "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "Je pense aussi. Nous n\u2019avons pas encore pu avoir la d\xE9position
      de ce journaliste suspect mais avec les informations que l\u2019on a je pense
      que l\u2019on peut commencer \xE0 rayer un de nos suspects."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 94f552401d853464eba92c33f32b25fd, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  - text: "A ton avis, qui n\u2019a pas pu r\xE9aliser le meurtre ? "
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21b87153fb3e5f94c809d9a129d0e1ee, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
  background: {fileID: 0}
  nextScene: {fileID: 0}
  conditionScene: {fileID: 0}
  conditionToUnlock: []
